title: Morse Code
text: Dot, dash, dot. The light ducks out of sight between the teleporters, and changes colour only where you can see it.
trick: teleporter pairs hide stretches of the beam; dopplers can only work on the visible dashes
motif: lines of morse code
ink: 2.5
expect: recolours>=3
